  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JPO UNICEF 2014 Fiji/Sudan DDR/Resilience JH</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">JPO UNICEF 2014 Fiji/Sudan DDR/Resilience JH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen riktar sig mot Agenda 2030 m&#xe5;let 13: Bek&#xe4;mpa klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar. Den tematiska inriktningen &#xe4;r m&#xe4;nsklig s&#xe4;kerhet i relation till katastrofer s&#xe5;som tyfoner, cykloner och seismisk aktivitet genom att s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lla beredskap f&#xf6;r de n&#xf6;dsituationer som kan uppst&#xe5;. Valet av JPO tj&#xe4;nst har f&#xf6;ljt Sveriges prioriteringar. Tj&#xe4;nsten f&#xf6;ljs upp av b&#xe5;de UNICEFoch Sida &#xe5;rligen dels vid beg&#xe4;ran om f&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngning av tj&#xe4;nst dels vid samtal/seminarier med Sida. .</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is addressed to the Agenda 2030 goal 13: Climate Action. Thematic area is human security in relation to catastrophes such as typhoons, cyclons and seismic activity by ensuring constant readiness to any emergency that may arise in the region. JPO program (Junior Professional Officers) are an important part of   the total Swedish focus on increased Swedish participation in international organizations. The program offers young graduates the   opportunity to serve in the UN and other international organizations.</narrative>
  </description>
